        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td>TimeStamp: <span data-field="timestamp">{{ timestamp }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td>ScreenSize: <span data-field="screen_size">{{ screen_size }}</span> <span data-field="screen_size_2">{{ screen_size_2 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td>ViewingDistance: <span data-field="viewing_distance">{{ viewing_distance }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td>No. of datapoints: <span data-field="num_datapoints">{{ num_datapoints }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td>Data Duration: <span data-field="data_duration">{{ data_duration }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td>No. of Markers: <span data-field="num_markers">{{ num_markers }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td>No. of Images: <span data-field="num_images">{{ num_images }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td>MovieFile: <span data-field="movie_file">{{ movie_file }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td>No. of Frames: <span data-field="num_frames">{{ num_frames }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td>Frame Rate: <span data-field="frame_rate">{{ frame_rate }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <span style="font-weight: bold;">Data_DataSummary:</span> Displays a window that contains information about the current data file.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <span style="font-size: 2em;">A</span>
    <div style="font-size: 0.9em;">Arrington Research</div>
  </div>
  <h3 style="font-size: 1.2em;">2.8 Dump Events Data</h3>
  <div class="figure-caption">Figure 8. Data Menu > Dump Events</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Data</th>
        <th>Help</th>
        <th>Event # and Total Elapsed Time</th>
        <th>Event Type</th>
        <th>Duration in Seconds</th>
        <th>Data Point Range</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for event in dump_events %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="dump_events[{{ loop.index0 }}].data_id">{{ event.data_id }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
        <td><span data-field="dump_events[{{ loop.index0 }}].elapsed_time">{{ event.elapsed_time }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="dump_events[{{ loop.index0 }}].event_type">{{ event.event_type }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="dump_events[{{ loop.index0 }}].duration">{{ event.duration }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="dump_events[{{ loop.index0 }}].data_point_range">{{ event.data_point_range }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
    1) <span style="font-weight: bold;">Marker:</span> 1st column is the Event number. 2nd column is the Total Time in seconds. 3rd column is the Marker string. The last column is the data point range for all the points in the fixation.
  </p>
  <p>
    2) <span style="font-weight: bold;">Image File Name:</span> 1st column is the Event number. 2nd column is the Total Time in seconds. 3rd column is the image file name.
  </p>
  <p>
    3) <span style="font-weight: bold;">Fixation:</span> 1st column is the Event number. 2nd column is the Total Time in seconds. 3rd column is the duration time for the fixation in seconds. 4th column is the average gaze x and y points for all the points in the fixation. Fixation in normalized coordinates. The last column is the data point range for all the points in the fixation.
  </p>
</div>



